Third-Party Software Notices and Attribution
============================================

This file aggregates license notices for third-party software bundled with the
cnpg4vscode VS Code extension. It is populated as runtime dependencies are
added. The `scripts/audit-deps.mjs` script enforces a license allowlist on
every CI run.

The current runtime dependencies are:

  - @kubernetes/client-node — Apache-2.0
    https://github.com/kubernetes-client/javascript

Development-only dependencies are listed in package.json and excluded from
this file because they are not shipped in the published VSIX.

For the complete set of bundled binaries (including those produced by
prebuilt native modules such as better-sqlite3 once added), see the
generated `dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt` file produced during `pnpm package`.
